__label__household liquitex matte varnish 236 ml there are many misconceptions about whether or not it is necessary to varnish an acrylic painting as a general rule you should always varnish your acrylic work when possible varnishes are applied over dry paint films and have several purposes the first and most important function is to protect the painting surface from the environment and protect the pigments from ultraviolet light secondly varnishes can be used to change or unify a painting s surface sheen liquitex varnishes come in several different sheens which can all be intermixed for a customized sheen
